_86%,#000)]">تعرّف علينا</a></div></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`motion v1 is frozen > about-classic without the v2 marker renders as before (reveal on, public) > en 1`] = `"<div data-section-id="d1" data-section-type="custom-section"><section data-node-id="d1-n1" data-node-type="section" class="relative isolate overflow-x-clip"><div data-node-id="d1-n2" data-node-type="container" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-(--sf-max-width,1280px) px-[clamp(16px,4vw,48px)]"><div data-node-id="d1-n3" data-node-type="grid" class="grid min-w-0"><img data-node-id="d1-n4" data-node-type="image" data-reveal="fade-up" src="https://cdn.test/https://images.pexels.com/photos/34674788/pexels-photo-34674788.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=1280" alt="Store photo" class="block w-full" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div data-node-id="d1-n5" data-node-type="vFlex" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-step="1" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><span data-node-id="d1-n6" data-node-type="badge" class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full bg-(--sf-shelf) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">Our story</span><h2 data-node-id="d1-n7" data-node-type="heading" class="text-balance text-2xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-3xl">We started with one question: will it last?</h2><p data-node-id="d1-n8" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">We opened after too many products stopped working. Everything we sell, we test ourselves first.</p><p data-node-id="d1-n9" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">Today we ship to every governorate and answer every message ourselves.</p><div data-node-id="d1-n10" data-node-type="button" class="flex"><a href="/about" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-(--sf-radius,12px) px-7 text-sm font-semibold transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0 bg-(--sf-brand) text-(--sf-